<title>FRANCE: Synthelabo H1 sales rose 12.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Synthelabo H1 sales rose 12.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 5,756    + 12.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - The group gave the figures in a statement. On a comparable basis sales rose seven percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
